 "description": "Forty dishes on the menu and not one picture. Scan it with Forq and every item appears with an image, calories, allergens and the price \u2014 laid out like your favorite delivery app.\n\nNo more ordering blind because \"branzino al cartoccio\" tells you nothing.\n\nWHAT FORQ DOES\n\n\u2022 Menu scanner \u2014 photograph any paper menu and Forq rebuilds it in seconds as a clean, scrollable digital menu, sorted by category.\n\n\u2022 An image for every dish \u2014 see the food before you order it. Images are AI-generated from the dish name.\n\n\u2022 Menu reader in your language \u2014 in Italy, Japan or Thailand, Forq reads the menu and shows it in English, with images to match.\n\n\u2022 Calories and nutrition \u2014 per-dish calorie, protein, fat and carb estimates, so eating out still fits your day.\n\n\u2022 Gluten, halal, vegan \u2014 mark what you avoid and Forq flags the dishes that suit you, plus the likely allergens in each one.\n\n\u2022 The real price \u2014 taxes and service charges are surfaced when the menu lists them, so the bill holds no surprises.\n\n\u2022 Show to waiter \u2014 build your order and show it in the menu's own language. No pointing, no guessing.\n\nPERFECT FOR\n\n\u2022 Menus with no photos, where the dish names tell you nothing\n\u2022 Traveling in Europe or Asia with a menu you can't read\n\u2022 Eating out while tracking calories\n\u2022 Celiac, halal, vegan and allergy needs\n\u2022 Anyone who has ordered a dish and been surprised by what arrived\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Photograph the paper menu.\n2. Forq recognizes it and builds your digital menu in seconds.\n3. Browse dishes with images, calories and prices \u2014 tap any item for details.\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nDish images and calorie figures are produced by AI from the dish name and are for guidance only. They may be inaccurate or differ from the actual dish. Always rely on the restaurant's own information for prices, ingredients, allergens and nutrition \u2014 especially if you have allergies or dietary restrictions.\n\nForq Plus unlocks an image for every dish, up to 6 menu pages per scan, and iCloud sync across your devices. Subscriptions renew automatically; manage or cancel anytime in your App Store settings.\n\nScan the menu. See the food. Order with confidence.\n\nTerms of Use: https://fforq.vercel.app/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://fforq.vercel.app/privacy",
